# What must never reach the deployment bundle.
#
# .env first and explicitly. It holds live Razorpay and model credentials, the CLI
# uploads the working directory rather than the git tree, and being gitignored is not
# the same as being unuploaded. Secrets belong in the project's environment variables,
# where they are encrypted and can be rotated without a redeploy.
.env
.env.local
*.key
data/contacts.json

# Local-only state. The audit log and outbox are written at runtime; shipping a
# development copy would seed the deployment with someone else's events.
audit/
runs/

# Not needed at runtime, and every megabyte is cold-start time.
.git/
.github/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
test_*.py
verify_all.py
bugs.md
ARCHITECTURE.md

# Lint and test configuration only - it has no [project] table, and the Python builder
# treats any pyproject.toml as a uv project and fails on `uv lock`. Dependencies are
# declared once, in requirements.txt, which is what the builder should read.
pyproject.toml
